      "tpd_reading": "<div>Natural and Step Response of RLC Circuits</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>Description:</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>This resource contains information on topics motivation, capacitor, ideal linear capacitor and rc circuit.</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>This resource contains information on topics second order systems, observed output, lc network and plotting the total solution.</div>\n</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div>The natural response of a resistor-inductor-capacitor circuit&nbsp;<br />\nRLC can take on three different forms, depending on the specific component values.</div>\n",
