      "tpd_reading": "<div>Introduction to the Laplace Transform</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>Description:</div>\n\n<div>The Laplace transform is a particular integral formula which is very useful to solve linear differential equations with certain conditions. The reason why you will prefer to use the Laplace transformation instead of any other method while solving certain linear differential equations directly, is because this method actually simplifies the process by being algebra-based instead of calculus-based.</div>\n",
